{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e4c9782e0be257a5fbe7af47db15a450a5295ba6c58c21c3b99efa0c85df1cc", "ja": "（定期公演が終わり、今は客席の片づけをしている。\n未来のステージ、かなり盛り上がっていたな）", "zh": "（定期公演结束了，现在正在收拾观众席。未来的舞台，气氛相当热烈啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1001_p", "source_sha256": "153ee5bbf1f0fa252cd2e60f230ed3d7599cb26fe611adee4e95c26252907e53", "ja": "あれ、未来？　なんでこんなところに……。\n着替えもしないで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦，未来？你怎么会在这种地方……  \n都还没换衣服，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6e44cdd4b0c5636a6bca6547f22f8fef1988ab7c1f48bc5e2c53d5faea147534", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nえっと……私、どうしたんだろう？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n那个……我这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "950a9f54f34b44a171964821326858a6d3bc3975f6592f41d9f0370cc1762f92", "ja": "なんだか、客席からステージを見たくなっちゃって……\n気が付いたらここまで、走ってきちゃいました！", "zh": "不知怎么的，突然想从观众席看看舞台……\n回过神来，已经一路跑到这里来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6af9b75e6f423dac230dc65e7d33e1ccb8ff819295b8c0bd057a8b75e8ee8d35", "ja": "なるほど……自分が立っていた今日のステージを、\n客席から見たくなった、とか？", "zh": "原来如此……就是突然想从观众席看看自己今天站过的舞台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "9214b2f8517c97abbff31b35f6b58d8a090333672909cf0d7769897cd5f7b1a5", "ja": "あ、そうかも！　さすが{$P$}さん♪\nここから見えるステージって、カッコイイですよね～。", "zh": "啊，说不定真是这样！不愧是{$P$}先生♪\n从这里看到的舞台，感觉很帅气呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "711bd5a2c1d6e09fd64d15099c086a97445d7e2aafd0e3e4e8476a729ea20065", "ja": "私たちって、あのステージに立つために\nいつもがんばってるんですよね……。", "zh": "我们一直在努力，就是为了能站上那个舞台……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "53e9daccf1fee435ffd58c1dcdbd36ef3443da91c1dfd5838ae91f04fdd0e408", "ja": "当たり前のことかもですけど、なんだか\nそういうの、すごいな～って思いました！", "zh": "虽然这可能是理所当然的事，\n但总觉得这种事，真的好了不起啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d78868dbca89c4c4ebfd6001195394b2cc1ab9d21f869b0d0a6f9ad8ce85c7f0", "ja": "そうだな。みんながいつもやってることの\n積み重ねで、劇場のステージができてるんだ。", "zh": "是啊。正是大家平时不断积累，才成就了剧场的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "560c56d517f974e8d6f69db95cffe88bf43661a3600cca0f75442bca47213dbc", "ja": "観てくれる人たちのためにがんばらなきゃ！って、\n練習中はいつも、必死ですけど……。", "zh": "为了来看演出的大家要努力才行！练习的时候一直都是拼尽全力的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "c609cb4eab62a63921fa74df363adb6e872d5c749841b76d9f23dea8ed5c94b4", "ja": "だけど、なんだか今日は終わってみて、\nいつもよりちょっと、さみしい気がします。", "zh": "可是，今天结束后，总觉得比平时稍微有些寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c3cebf3cc14cb76cd4686655460cafe1e4ae98b53fb53934521de904e0c38daa", "ja": "それだけ、全力だったって事だろうな。\n全部出し切って、燃え尽きちゃった的な……。", "zh": "看来这也说明我们拼尽了全力吧。把一切都发挥出来，像是燃烧殆尽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "8dd56d5cc7ce6a3fe2eb9409884c11e44a8be3efa829d336d1aeed16f7cbd4b3", "ja": "ええっ！　私、燃え尽きちゃったんですか？", "zh": "诶诶！我这是燃尽了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e3c30f3cd5b9a48a78e7af47d3d0540e6c9e4c70ee1db754e8b3a96156d14703", "ja": "い、いや……でもほら、すぐ次の公演もあるから！\n大丈夫、大丈夫！", "zh": "没、没有啦……不过你看，马上就有下一场演出了！\n没事的，没事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "e3990267a3d04e0ae4bb4fcfe5acfe43f642801c18033f27c0b3240e9a39f9bf", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね！　よかった～♪", "zh": "啊，对哦！太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "990920357a6703b30aa2fde9baf68735cae51f230b51b302788dadd937a351cf", "ja": "次の公演でも、いろいろチャレンジしたいです。\n新しい歌も、ダンスも。もっと、もーっと。", "zh": "下一场公演也想挑战各种各样的事情。\n无论是新歌，还是舞蹈。要更加、更加努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1017_p", "source_sha256": "185b0263c25f59558a560128d6f62c5113692c90e34d91c84410c5b5f40af0dc", "ja": "ああ、どんどんやっていこう！　次の公演は前のもの\nより、少しでもいいものにしなきゃいけないんだ。", "zh": "啊啊，尽管放手去做吧！下一场公演\n一定要比之前的更好，哪怕只好一点点也行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "79b985736085c277803800e7bf828cef9a5ada7a4d219e4cfb2ae8811546ccce", "ja": "だから、燃え尽きているヒマなんかないぞ！", "zh": "所以，哪有时间燃尽热情啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c6fec1e0277105604fec9f1f51d7c82356a59fe80458419006d56994832fef2", "ja": "それって……お客さんももっともーっと、\n私たちに期待してくれる、ってことですよね？", "zh": "也就是说……客人们也会对我们抱有更多更多的期待，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "816095ebc652bc7ddef6b7d5d7da4233e5ee45db2223f164811c4863bc6ca6b5", "ja": "期待して、待っててもらえるなら……\n私もすっごく、すーっごく！　楽しみです！", "zh": "如果大家愿意期待着、等着我们的话……\n我也超级、超——级期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f4f46606eb008a72095f5e0c1a5b82942a764ff8f32a705b627dc85bccd1587a", "ja": "おっ、楽しみか！", "zh": "哦，很期待吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "b2df954811d442ee964a8b095ead65e08f079b26473f1db19a9c9794066e1b7b", "ja": "はい！　私、もっともっと！　たくさん、アイドルを\nやっていたいですから！　5年後も、10年後も！", "zh": "是的！我还想一直一直做偶像！所以，5年后也好，10年后也好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6d08e71571ec19cdf4af77e3fa9ae060b632916de1c0f321224160e85bc0a756", "ja": "そうだな。5年後も、10年後も……もっと先も。\n未来のプロデュースをしていたいな。", "zh": "是啊。5年后，10年后……再往后也一样。  \n我想一直为未来的偶像进行制作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "d104f7e1aec92982fce98f1cd077f546605d29e1e8bcf64b564a00b061f81f9c", "ja": "本当ですか！？　でへへ、嬉しいな～♪\nでへ、でへへ……♪", "zh": "真的吗！？　嘿嘿，好开心啊～♪\n嘿、嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0264_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b90769b509e57dbee75b3a4cdb7b6c28880e930e40b9d4c8e7dade0063cc9da", "ja": "{$P$}さん、約束ですよ！\nこれからもずっとずーっと、私の隣にいてくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，说好了哦！\n今后也一定要一直一直，待在我的身边哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
